   "title": "Indian tax system: types of taxes, direct and indirect taxes",
   "parts": [
    {
     "t": "Types of taxes",
     "items": [
      [
       "t",
       [
        "Type",
        "Meaning"
       ],
       [
        [
         "**Progressive Tax**",
         "Average tax burden increases with income"
        ],
        [
         "**Regressive Tax**",
         "Relative burden tends to be higher on lower-income groups"
        ],
        [
         "**Proportional Tax**",
         "Same tax rate regardless of income level"
        ],
        [
         "**Degressive Tax**",
         "Rate initially rises with income, then becomes flat"
        ]
       ],
       "Indian Economy #44"
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "Direct tax and indirect tax",
     "items": [
      [
       "b",
       "**Direct Tax:** Tax burden cannot be shifted to another person; incidence and impact fall on the same taxpayer.",
       "Indian Economy #44"
      ],
      [
       "b",
       "**Direct Tax examples:** Income Tax; Corporation Tax; Wealth Tax; Capital Gains Tax; Property Tax; Gift Tax.",
       "Indian Economy #44"
      ],
      [
       "b",
       "**Indirect Tax:** Tax burden can be shifted to another person, generally through prices.",
       "Indian Economy #44"
      ],
      [
       "b",
       "**Indirect Tax examples:** Customs Duty; Excise Duty; Service Tax; Sales Tax; VAT; GST.",
       "Indian Economy #44"
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "Individual taxes and their key associations",
     "items": [
      [
       "t",
       [
        "Tax",
        "Key association"
       ],
       [
        [
         "**Income Tax**",
         "Income → Direct"
        ],
        [
         "**Corporation Tax**",
         "Company income/profit → Direct"
        ],
        [
         "**Capital Gains Tax**",
         "Gain from sale of capital asset"
        ],
        [
         "**Wealth Tax**",
         "Wealth → historical tax"
        ],
        [
         "**Customs Duty**",
         "Import/export of goods → Indirect"
        ],
        [
         "**Excise Duty**",
         "Production/sale/licensing of specified goods → Indirect"
        ],
        [
         "**VAT**",
         "Value added at stages → Indirect"
        ],
        [
         "**Service Tax**",
         "Services → historical indirect tax"
        ]
       ],
       "Indian Economy #44"
      ]
     ]
    },
